							"type": "paragraph",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "If "
								},
								{
									"type": "inlineCode",
									"value": "/blog/26"
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": " is requested, and it exists, the page will be generated on-demand. This behavior can be changed by using a different "
